  "name": "Satellite Data - SeaWIFS, 1997-present",
  "description": "Satellite Imagery from September, 1997 to present; North America Pacific Coast from Baja California to the arctic.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Detection of phytoplankton blooms, biomass in the ocean.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not secured in regional data centre. Data could be replaced but would require time and effort. Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Data are related to a subject, location or species of concern within the scientific, government or public community within the last 5 years. Impact of Loss: Medium Recommended Action: Back up the CD collection, or, provide secured storage.",
